diff --git a/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md b/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md
index a4f48b5..bf0761e 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md
@@ -2,6 +2,38 @@
 
 Webhooks notify another application when something happens on a board. Only account admins can list, view, create, update, delete, or reactivate webhooks.
 
+## Receiving events
+
+When an event is committed, Fizzy queues a delivery for each active webhook on that board subscribed to the event's action. Fizzy sends an HTTP `POST` with `Content-Type: application/json`. The payload describes the event as it was when it occurred:
+
+```json
+{
+  "event": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohde",
+    "action": "card_closed",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "creator": { "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7", "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson" },
+    "eventable": {
+      "type": "Card",
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohdb",
+      "url": "https://fizzy.example.com/897362094/cards/1"
+    }
+  },
+  "board": { "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy" }
+}
+```
+
+Fizzy includes these headers:
+
+- `X-Webhook-Delivery-Id`: the unique ID of this delivery.
+- `X-Webhook-Timestamp`: the UTC timestamp when the delivery attempt started.
+- `X-Webhook-Signature`: a hex-encoded HMAC-SHA256 of the raw request body, using the webhook's signing secret as the key. Verify the signature before processing the event.
+
+Receiver URLs must resolve to public IP addresses. Each webhook gets one delivery attempt per event. Fizzy does not retry failed or interrupted attempts, or follow redirects. A `2xx` response is a success; other HTTP responses and network errors are logged as failures. If a connection is interrupted, Fizzy may not know whether the receiver processed the POST.
+
+Fizzy switches a webhook off when it has failed at least 10 times in a row and at least one hour has elapsed since the first failure in that streak. A successful delivery or reactivation resets the streak. An inactive webhook does not receive new events. Delivery history is retained for one week.
+
 ## `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/webhooks`
 
 Returns a paginated list of webhooks for a board.
